        '- (POSSIBLE PASSIVE dec.passive.trial_enc_t9 (Unbroken Stance [Rare] …)) "I accept it. Let it settle in me." → {"commands":[{"seq":1,"type":"development.accept","offer":"dec.passive.trial_enc_t9","replace":null,"quote":"I accept it"}]}\n' +
